imestamp": "01:47:40", "text": "它的伤害稍微低一些，但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6463.43, "timestamp": "01:47:43", "text": "确实有……嗯，你可以……的实用性"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6468.87, "timestamp": "01:47:48", "text": "可以拉动生物。所以，嗯，到底是什么？所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6471.109, "timestamp": "01:47:51", "text": "很好。它能造成不错的伤害"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6474.79, "timestamp": "01:47:54", "text": "具有支持价值的 canrip"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6476.47, "timestamp": "01:47:56", "text": "因为你可以把它们拉进你的“喜欢”里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6479.35, "timestamp": "01:47:59", "text": "例如一线人员。"}]